    "description": "PioneerX AI API Collection — Backend v1.4.\n\nChanges from v1.3:\n- Section-scoped chatbot (Conversations)\n- Generate action steps + suggested links from conversation\n- Removed POST /sections/:key/generate\n- Removed Shopify integrations\n- Removed Tools & Features / AI Tips (admin + output)\n- Free tier max 3 business profiles",
